  "lines": [
    {"page": 1, "start": 0, "end": 77, "top": 72.0, "left": 180.0, "lastX": 511.2, "baseline": 82.58, "inkLeft": 180.07, "text": "The morning ferry crosses the estuary twice before the tide turns, carrying "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 77, "end": 155, "top": 85.2, "left": 180.0, "lastX": 526.8, "baseline": 96.02, "inkLeft": 180.07, "text": "commuters, bicycles and crates of vegetables from the farms on the far shore. "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 155, "end": 234, "top": 99.0, "left": 180.0, "lastX": 535.8, "baseline": 109.46, "inkLeft": 180.07, "text": "Nobody on board hurries; they read, drink tea from flasks and watch the herons "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 234, "end": 315, "top": 112.2, "left": 180.0, "lastX": 537.0, "baseline": 122.93, "inkLeft": 180.07, "text": "stand in the shallows. When the ferry docks, a short queue forms along the jetty "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 315, "end": 368, "top": 126.0, "left": 180.0, "lastX": 414.6, "baseline": 136.37, "inkLeft": 180.07, "text": "and the deckhand coils the rope with practised ease.\u000d"},
    {"page": 1, "start": 368, "end": 470, "top": 145.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 540.0, "baseline": 155.81, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "A well-made map leaves out far more than it shows. The cartographer decides which roads matter, which "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 470, "end": 575, "top": 158.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 526.8, "baseline": 169.25, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "rivers deserve a name and where a label may sit without hiding a village. Every choice trades detail for "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 575, "end": 677, "top": 172.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 522.6, "baseline": 182.69, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "clarity, and the reader trusts the result because the trades were made carefully and applied the same "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 677, "end": 705, "top": 185.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 197.4, "baseline": 196.13, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "way across the whole sheet.\u000d"},
    {"page": 1, "start": 705, "end": 782, "top": 204.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 403.8, "baseline": 215.35, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "In the workshop the lamps stay lit late. Shavings gather under the bench, a "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 782, "end": 866, "top": 217.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 404.4, "baseline": 228.79, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "kettle ticks as it cools, and the half-finished chair waits for its last joint. The "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 866, "end": 945, "top": 231.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 418.2, "baseline": 242.23, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "maker steps back, squints along the rail and decides that tomorrow will do for "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 945, "end": 1021, "top": 244.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 408.6, "baseline": 255.67, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "the glue, since good work is not improved by being rushed past the point of "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1021, "end": 1027, "top": 258.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 93.6, "baseline": 269.11, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "care.\u000d"},
